---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Sector Expertise"
description: "Specialist recruitment across Engineering, Industrial, Civil Engineering and IT for employers across the UK South West."
---
<header class="page-header">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="{{ '/' | url }}">Home</a> / <a href="{{ '/for-clients/' | url }}">For Clients</a> / Sector Expertise</p>
    <span class="eyebrow">Sector Expertise</span>
    <h1>Four sectors. One consistent standard.</h1>
    <p>Our consultants work within a single specialism, so they speak your technical language and already know where the right candidates are.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<section>
  <div class="container">
    {% for sector in sectors %}
    <div class="case-study" id="{{ sector.slug }}">
      <div class="case-study__figure">{{ sector.name }}</div>
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">{{ sector.name }}</span>
        <h2>{{ sector.summary }}</h2>
        <p>Typical roles we resource:</p>
        <ul class="list-check">
          {% for role in sector.roles %}
          <li>{{ role }}</li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
        <div class="hero__actions" style="margin-top:1.5rem;">
          <a class="btn btn--secondary btn--small" href="{{ '/for-candidates/jobs/' | url }}?sector={{ sector.name | urlencode }}">View {{ sector.name }} roles</a>
          <a class="btn btn--ghost btn--small" href="{{ '/contact/' | url }}">Brief us on a vacancy</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section--slate">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-band">
      <div>
        <h2>Don't see your sector listed?</h2>
        <p>We regularly flex into adjacent disciplines — talk to us about your specific brief.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="{{ '/contact/' | url }}">Get in touch</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
